{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Exterminator on a crusade against the spider horde taking over the multiverse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends via online co-op for up to 4 players, blast through the story campaign, and show these pests who\u2019s boss. Or, jump into a frenetic Humans vs Spiders PvP mode for some laughs and screams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, one thing is certain \u2013 it\u2019s time to KILL IT WITH FIRE!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/a8e46f7e19cfe78239a368b16a8d7f8c.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war on the eight-legged monsters with an arsenal of 45 weapons and gadgets worthy of the Exterminator. Will your team smash the pests with a newspaper, burn them to a crisp, rev up the minigun, unleash a rocket launcher, or wield a laser sword?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/7ff015d27210aff282ba3c0207fc5c9e.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic spider hunt across seven distinct worlds. Exterminate the pesky arachnids in a mysterious manor, liberate a town in the Wild West, explore cyberspace, and descend into Spider Hell. Every level is a unique battle against the spiders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6975991f694027638dd98b63b49dbc38.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew magic potions in a bubbling cauldron. Demolish a megapolis as a kaiju-sized madman. Defend a cacti-owned saloon from waves of spiders. Win a drone race in virtual reality. There are more than 60 challenges to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/e734c20e77fd259369245410c25df211.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Okay, all this spider-hunting sounds fun, but what if I want to play as a spider?\u2019 you might ask. And yes, you can indeed play as a spider in an online 8-player PvP mode called Spider Hunt. It\u2019s actual humans vs actual arachnids (also controlled by humans)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dimensions to save from the spider onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    60+ unique in-game challenges to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    45 weapons and gadgets to unlock and craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A campaign that\u2019s fully playable solo or in 4-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Slapstick plot written by Miles Luna (RWBY, Red vs Blue)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    'Spider Hunt\u2019 PvP multiplayer mode for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    20+ hours of content with at least 3 loud laughs guaranteed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    15.7 billion spiders to exterminate across the multiverse</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Compound X Gon' Give It To Ya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/47585ede089545a0cf0362d0ee94cff968729956.jpg"},{"name":"Tinker, Tailor, Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/6102a84cb51660615a48cbe5d9f7c66adce34f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/cdab7fa6d19d84330b9aa55000a5e15f1d66e61c.jpg"},{"name":"Story Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/93d4693a9a75e9715c4bde4611625465e60a0f80.jpg"},{"name":"Prop Hunt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/9671ffce764fb670d58a871321981ed8a84b5dd1.jpg"},{"name":"Toil and Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/d4e99c2f4cb486a68a987ea5a3695b3acf3569e3.jpg"},{"name":"Back in Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/cc2ce1fac2d4ec0ec854f42af9f0482ae0ece938.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/ab0d93df21cbfe9ff6c8603e4614cef36782a28a.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/d41c81526a124b8dfedf3a07408541acf05501c2.jpg"},{"name":"Reasonable Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2357000/4520e5778b5839ed117622177e37c539f96e9321.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2357000?t=1772093751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772093751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/449218b13a013a3603474ce72b552b4d89d968bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772093751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/449218b13a013a3603474ce72b552b4d89d968bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772093751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Exterminator on a crusade against the spider horde taking over the multiverse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends via online co-op for up to 4 players, blast through the story campaign, and show these pests who\u2019s boss. Or, jump into a frenetic Humans vs Spiders PvP mode for some laughs and screams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, one thing is certain \u2013 it\u2019s time to KILL IT WITH FIRE!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/a8e46f7e19cfe78239a368b16a8d7f8c.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war on the eight-legged monsters with an arsenal of 45 weapons and gadgets worthy of the Exterminator. Will your team smash the pests with a newspaper, burn them to a crisp, rev up the minigun, unleash a rocket launcher, or wield a laser sword?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/7ff015d27210aff282ba3c0207fc5c9e.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic spider hunt across seven distinct worlds. Exterminate the pesky arachnids in a mysterious manor, liberate a town in the Wild West, explore cyberspace, and descend into Spider Hell. Every level is a unique battle against the spiders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6975991f694027638dd98b63b49dbc38.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew magic potions in a bubbling cauldron. Demolish a megapolis as a kaiju-sized madman. Defend a cacti-owned saloon from waves of spiders. Win a drone race in virtual reality. There are more than 60 challenges to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/e734c20e77fd259369245410c25df211.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.poster.avif?t=1772093751\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.webm?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.mp4?t=1772093751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Okay, all this spider-hunting sounds fun, but what if I want to play as a spider?\u2019 you might ask. And yes, you can indeed play as a spider in an online 8-player PvP mode called Spider Hunt. It\u2019s actual humans vs actual arachnids (also controlled by humans)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dimensions to save from the spider onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    60+ unique in-game challenges to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    45 weapons and gadgets to unlock and craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph